      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner would submit that false case was filed against the petitioner/A1 vide F.I.R.No.129 of 2023 for the offence punishable under Section 420 IPC, 7(1) of the Essential Commodities Act, 1955, which are punishable with less than seven years of imprisonment.",
