      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Considering the above facts and circumstances, the police are directed to follow the procedure contemplated under Section 41A of Cr.P.C., as directed by the Hon'ble Apex Court in Arnesh Kumar Vs. State of Bihar and another1.\n(Contd..) (2014) 8 SCC 273 //2//",
